note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note TWIN of unroll-break-nested.om with every unroll removed (section 4 line 91, erratum E7): same expectation.
note Contract section 4 line 90 and erratum E7: a break whose innermost loop is a ROLLED loop nested in an
note unrolled body is allowed and leaves the rolled loop. Each of the 4 copies adds 1 once: exit 4.
note Twins unroll-break-nested-rolled.om / -om1.om, same expectation (oracle/s3s4/exp).
om2
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4
for j ulong 3
if eq j 1
break
end
s = add s 1
end
end
ret int s
end
